@money

The strings of reality lay before you.

- @partycash
- @govcash
- @planning
- @return

@partycash
title: Greed is a sin, Tovarishch, remember that.
on-arrival: resources += 9999

What else lies beyond the veil?

@govcash
title: Greed is a sin, Tovarishch, remember that.
on-arrival: budget += 9999

What else lies beyond the veil?

@planning
title: Every crisis has a solution.

The strings of reality lay before you.

- @leftplan
- @reformistplan
- @laborplan
- @return

@leftplan
title: Socialization is your goal?
on-arrival: nationalization_adopted = 1;

What else lies beyond the veil?

@reformistplan
title: Moderation is your goal?
on-arrival: moderate_plan_adopted = 1;

What else lies beyond the veil?

@laborplan
title: Public Works are your goal?
on-arrival: wtb_adopted = 1;

What else lies beyond the veil?

